<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND WINS PLN 5.5 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND WINS PLN 5.5 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish software firm ComputerLand Poland SA signed a 5.5-million-zloty contract with the finance ministry for the providing of 3,000 terminals and 500 servers, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Delivery of the goods must take place within 15 weeks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
